WEBVTT

00:00:01.503 --> 00:00:11.300
Sign in, with the list read held 3 s at the local stand-in: the brand loader, then the list.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:17.713
The list on its warm ground, under the header's glass tint (a tint, not a blur, on Android).

00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:22.833
More options: the menu grows from its button; Back closes it.

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:27.224
A row: ripple and pressed ground; the subscription slides in.

00:00:27.224 --> 00:00:29.495
Edit details (a press on the spring): a scroll to the editor; with content under it, the header turns solid.

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:30.818
Back: the subscription slides away.
